sequenceDiagram
  participant G as Grove
  participant N as Runner (job, terminal, channel)
  participant X as harness-dispatch beside Grove
  participant P as Owner policy
  participant H as Harness
  Note over G,H: Lifecycle session: bare grove
  G->>N: run --kind --task-file --task-id --prompt + session_name, worktree, repo
  N->>X: Spawn as the foreground job, completion channel in its environment
  X->>P: select(request)
  alt Policy refuses, or no policy
    X-->>N: Diagnostic + remedy + inspect line on the terminal, nonzero exit
    N-->>G: Ended without a completion signal
    Note over G: Leaf stays live, loop stops, rerunning grove continues
  else Command selected
    X->>H: Record the run, then exec: same process, same job
    H-->>N: Completion signal, then the runner's escalation
  end
  Note over G,H: Standalone invocation: grove run KIND
  G->>G: Stage the private working directory
  G->>X: inspect --json --kind --prompt + parameters, in Grove's own environment
  X->>P: select(request), outside the sandbox
  X-->>G: The command, as data. No run is recorded
  G->>N: The reported command + confinement
  N->>H: Spawn inside the sandbox, no terminal, small environment
  H-->>N: Completion signal, then outputs are published
